question:
What is the output of the following Java program?
```java
public class ReturnFinallyFlow {
    public static int compute() {
        try {
            return 10;
        } finally {
            System.out.print("Finally ");
        }
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(compute());
    }
}
```

