What is the output of the following Java program when no exception occurs?
```java
public class NormalFlowTest {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            System.out.print("A ");
        } catch (Exception e) {
            System.out.print("B ");
        } finally {
            System.out.print("C ");
        }
        System.out.print("D");
    }
}
